# Plan Plugin - Statement of Work Generation

## Overview

This plugin translates Specify artifacts into client-facing Statement of Work (SoW) documents.

**Purpose**: Generate Statements of Work from structured Specify artifacts.

## Plugin Architecture

```
/plugins/plan/
├── .cursor-plugin/
│   └── plugin.json      # Plugin manifest
├── rules/
│   └── plan.mdc          # This file
└── skills/
    └── sow-writer/        # Statement of Work generation
```

Each skill has its own SKILL.md with full details. The Specify artifact format (specs + design.md) is described in [specify.md](../../references/specify.md).

